README.md-9-- **Multi-provider support**: AWS Bedrock and Google Vertex AI implemented, OpenAI and Anthropic stubbed, plus a built-in Mock. Scored per method in [Providers](#providers) — a provider can implement one of `AIProvider`'s two methods without the other
README.md:10:- **Tool system**: Register custom tools with a JSON Schema `inputSchema`, executed in parallel within a configurable tool loop. The schema is forwarded to the model to shape the call it produces; it is **not** enforced before your executor runs, so validate the input you are handed
README.md-11-- **Streaming**: Real-time WebSocket streaming with thinking tag parsing and entry-based protocol
README.md-12-- **Pluggable auth**: Bring your own WebSocket and HTTP authentication
README.md-13-- **Pluggable session store**: In-memory default, swap in Redis/database/etc.
